## Goal
Make the `serve` UI session secret persistent per user, so that reloading the UI after a restart on the same port keeps the session working.

## Problems
None recorded. The session slice was empty, so this note is based only on the commit message.

## Decision
The session secret is stored per user in `~/.config/portero/ui-session` with 0600 permissions. A restart on the same port reuses the stored secret instead of generating a new one, so an open browser tab survives the restart. The file mode restricts access to the owning user, which keeps the secret as protected as it was in memory.

